    "texto2C1V_pt": "9.4. <u>Data de Materialização da Perda</u>. Para todos os fins e efeitos deste Contrato, uma Perda será considerada como tendo sido incorrida quando, conforme aplicável: (i) no efetivo desembolso pela Parte Indenizável de fundos (por meios de pagamento em espécie e/ou dação em pagamento) referentes a tal Perda, seja em razão de decisão judicial, administrativa ou arbitral ou da celebração e/ou de acordo em uma determinada Demanda; e/ou (ii) em se tratando de Perdas referentes à insuficiência, insubsistência ou inexistência de ativos, na data do lançamento contábil relevante; e/ou (iii) em se tratando de passivos não contabilizados (off-balance), na data do reconhecimento contábil do referido passivo; e/ou (iv) em se tratando de Perdas decorrentes de arresto, penhora, indisponibilidade, liminar, constrição judicial, administrativa ou de qualquer outra forma de restrição que recaia sobre bens, ativos ou direitos de qualquer Parte Indenizável da Compradora (\"<u>Limitação</u>\"), serão considerados incorridos na data da efetiva imposição da Limitação sobre o respectivo bem, ativo ou direito, conforme o ato oficial que a determinar, independentemente da data em que tais Perdas venham a ser quantificadas, pagas ou exigidas.",
    "texto2C2V_pt": "9.4. <u>Data de Materialização da Perda</u>. Para todos os fins e efeitos deste Contrato, uma Perda será considerada como tendo sido incorrida quando, conforme aplicável: (i) no efetivo desembolso pela Parte Indenizável de fundos (por meios de pagamento em espécie e/ou dação em pagamento) referentes a tal Perda, seja em razão de decisão judicial, administrativa ou arbitral ou da celebração e/ou de acordo em uma determinada Demanda; e/ou (ii) em se tratando de Perdas referentes à insuficiência, insubsistência ou inexistência de ativos, na data do lançamento contábil relevante; e/ou (iii) em se tratando de passivos não contabilizados (off-balance), na data do reconhecimento contábil do referido passivo; e/ou (iv) em se tratando de Perdas decorrentes de arresto, penhora, indisponibilidade, liminar, constrição judicial, administrativa ou de qualquer outra forma de restrição que recaia sobre bens, ativos ou direitos de qualquer Parte Indenizável da Compradora (\"<u>Limitação</u>\"), serão considerados incorridos na data da efetiva imposição da Limitação sobre o respectivo bem, ativo ou direito, conforme o ato oficial que a determinar, independentemente da data em que tais Perdas venham a ser quantificadas, pagas ou exigidas.",
    "texto1C1V_en": "9.4. <u>Date of Loss Materialization</u>. For all purposes of this Agreement, a Loss shall be deemed to have been incurred when, as applicable: (i) upon actual disbursement by the Indemnified Party of funds (by means of cash payment and/or payment in kind) relating to such Loss, whether as a result of a judicial, administrative or arbitral decision or the execution and/or settlement of a particular Claim; and/or (ii) in the case of Losses relating to the insufficiency, non-existence or absence of assets, on the date of the relevant accounting entry; and/or (iii) in the case of off-balance sheet liabilities, on the date of the accounting recognition of such liability; and/or (iv) in the case of Losses arising from attachment, garnishment, unavailability, injunction, judicial or administrative restraint or any other form of restriction on assets, property or rights of any Buyer Indemnified Party (\"<u>Restriction</u>\"), such Losses shall be deemed incurred on the date of the effective imposition of the Restriction on the respective asset, property or right, as determined by the official act imposing it, regardless of the date on which such Losses are quantified, paid or demanded.",
    "texto1C2V_en": "9.4. <u>Date of Loss Materialization</u>. For all purposes of this Agreement, a Loss shall be deemed to have been incurred when, as applicable: (i) upon actual disbursement by the Indemnified Party of funds (by means of cash payment and/or payment in kind) relating to such Loss, whether as a result of a judicial, administrative or arbitral decision or the execution and/or settlement of a particular Claim; and/or (ii) in the case of Losses relating to the insufficiency, non-existence or absence of assets, on the date of the relevant accounting entry; and/or (iii) in the case of off-balance sheet liabilities, on the date of the accounting recognition of such liability; and/or (iv) in the case of Losses arising from attachment, garnishment, unavailability, injunction, judicial or administrative restraint or any other form of restriction on assets, property or rights of any Buyer Indemnified Party (\"<u>Restriction</u>\"), such Losses shall be deemed incurred on the date of the effective imposition of the Restriction on the respective asset, property or right, as determined by the official act imposing it, regardless of the date on which such Losses are quantified, paid or demanded.",
    "texto2C1V_en": "9.4. <u>Date of Loss Materialization</u>. For all purposes of this Agreement, a Loss shall be deemed to have been incurred when, as applicable: (i) upon actual disbursement by the Indemnified Party of funds (by means of cash payment and/or payment in kind) relating to such Loss, whether as a result of a judicial, administrative or arbitral decision or the execution and/or settlement of a particular Claim; and/or (ii) in the case of Losses relating to the insufficiency, non-existence or absence of assets, on the date of the relevant accounting entry; and/or (iii) in the case of off-balance sheet liabilities, on the date of the accounting recognition of such liability; and/or (iv) in the case of Losses arising from attachment, garnishment, unavailability, injunction, judicial or administrative restraint or any other form of restriction on assets, property or rights of any Buyer Indemnified Party (\"<u>Restriction</u>\"), such Losses shall be deemed incurred on the date of the effective imposition of the Restriction on the respective asset, property or right, as determined by the official act imposing it, regardless of the date on which such Losses are quantified, paid or demanded.",
    "texto2C2V_en": "9.4. <u>Date of Loss Materialization</u>. For all purposes of this Agreement, a Loss shall be deemed to have been incurred when, as applicable: (i) upon actual disbursement by the Indemnified Party of funds (by means of cash payment and/or payment in kind) relating to such Loss, whether as a result of a judicial, administrative or arbitral decision or the execution and/or settlement of a particular Claim; and/or (ii) in the case of Losses relating to the insufficiency, non-existence or absence of assets, on the date of the relevant accounting entry; and/or (iii) in the case of off-balance sheet liabilities, on the date of the accounting recognition of such liability; and/or (iv) in the case of Losses arising from attachment, garnishment, unavailability, injunction, judicial or administrative restraint or any other form of restriction on assets, property or rights of any Buyer Indemnified Party (&quot;<u>Restriction</u>&quot;), such Losses shall be deemed incurred on the date of the effective imposition of the Restriction on the respective asset, property or right, as determined by the official act imposing it, regardless of the date on which such Losses are quantified, paid or demanded.",
