    "texto1C2V_en": "3.2. <u>Payment of the Acquisition Price</u>. The Acquisition Price shall be paid by the Buyer to the Sellers by wire transfer to the Sellers' bank accounts indicated in Schedule 3.2, in the proportion set forth in Schedule 2.1.2, as follows:\n(a) <u>Closing Installment</u>. On the Closing Date, the amount of R$[AMOUNT] (\"<u>Closing Installment</u>\");\n(b) <u>[Escrow Amount</u>. The amount of R$[AMOUNT] shall be withheld from the Acquisition Price by the Buyer on the Closing Date as security for the indemnification obligations assumed by the Sellers under this Agreement, and shall be released to the Sellers pursuant to Clause 9.12.2 below;]\n(c) <u>First Deferred Installment</u>. R$[AMOUNT][, plus the positive variation of the CDI rate, pro rata die, from the Closing Date until the date of actual payment,] shall be paid by the Buyer to the Sellers on the 1st (first) anniversary of the Closing Date (\"<u>First Deferred Installment</u>\"); and\n(d) <u>Second Deferred Installment</u>. R$[AMOUNT][, plus the positive variation of the CDI rate, pro rata die, from the Closing Date until the date of actual payment,] shall be paid by the Buyer to the Sellers on the 2nd (second) anniversary of the Closing Date (\"Second Deferred Installment\", and together with the First Deferred Installment, the \"Deferred Installments\").",
