    "texto2C1V_pt": "1.3. <u>Negociação Conjunta</u>. As Partes foram assistidas por seus respectivos advogados e participaram da negociação e da redação do presente Contrato. Em caso de ambiguidade ou questionamento quanto à intenção ou à interpretação, o presente Contrato será interpretado como tendo sido redigido em conjunto pelas Partes, sem presunção ou ônus de prova em favor de ou em detrimento de qualquer signatário, em razão da autoria de qualquer das disposições do presente Contrato, tendo sido observada e respeitada a alocação de riscos acordada pelas Partes, tudo de acordo com os artigos 421 e 421-A da Lei nº 10.406/2002. As Partes declaram que, independentemente de quem tenha inicialmente disponibilizado as minutas e a redação das cláusulas, durante a negociação dos termos e condições deste Contrato, cada uma das disposições e condições do Contrato foi discutida, de modo que o presente Contrato reflete o interesse de cada uma delas em efetivar a Transação e termos e condições com os quais concordam.",
    "texto2C2V_pt": "1.3. <u>Negociação Conjunta</u>. As Partes foram assistidas por seus respectivos advogados e participaram da negociação e da redação do presente Contrato. Em caso de ambiguidade ou questionamento quanto à intenção ou à interpretação, o presente Contrato será interpretado como tendo sido redigido em conjunto pelas Partes, sem presunção ou ônus de prova em favor de ou em detrimento de qualquer signatário, em razão da autoria de qualquer das disposições do presente Contrato, tendo sido observada e respeitada a alocação de riscos acordada pelas Partes, tudo de acordo com os artigos 421 e 421-A da Lei nº 10.406/2002. As Partes declaram que, independentemente de quem tenha inicialmente disponibilizado as minutas e a redação das cláusulas, durante a negociação dos termos e condições deste Contrato, cada uma das disposições e condições do Contrato foi discutida, de modo que o presente Contrato reflete o interesse de cada uma delas em efetivar a Transação e termos e condições com os quais concordam.",
    "texto1C1V_en": "1.3. <u>Joint Negotiation</u>. The Parties have been assisted by their respective counsel and have participated in the negotiation and drafting of this Agreement. In the event of any ambiguity or question of intent or interpretation, this Agreement shall be construed as having been drafted jointly by the Parties, and no presumption or burden of proof shall arise favoring or disfavoring any signatory by virtue of the authorship of any provision of this Agreement, the allocation of risks agreed by the Parties having been observed and respected, all in accordance with articles 421 and 421-A of Law No. 10,406/2002. The Parties represent that, regardless of which Party initially provided the drafts and the wording of the clauses, each of the provisions and conditions of this Agreement was discussed during the negotiation of its terms and conditions, such that this Agreement reflects the interest of each of them in consummating the Transaction on terms and conditions with which they agree.",
    "texto1C2V_en": "1.3. <u>Joint Negotiation</u>. The Parties have been assisted by their respective counsel and have participated in the negotiation and drafting of this Agreement. In the event of any ambiguity or question of intent or interpretation, this Agreement shall be construed as having been drafted jointly by the Parties, and no presumption or burden of proof shall arise favoring or disfavoring any signatory by virtue of the authorship of any provision of this Agreement, the allocation of risks agreed by the Parties having been observed and respected, all in accordance with articles 421 and 421-A of Law No. 10,406/2002. The Parties represent that, regardless of which Party initially provided the drafts and the wording of the clauses, each of the provisions and conditions of this Agreement was discussed during the negotiation of its terms and conditions, such that this Agreement reflects the interest of each of them in consummating the Transaction on terms and conditions with which they agree.",
    "texto2C1V_en": "1.3. <u>Joint Negotiation</u>. The Parties have been assisted by their respective counsel and have participated in the negotiation and drafting of this Agreement. In the event of any ambiguity or question of intent or interpretation, this Agreement shall be construed as having been drafted jointly by the Parties, and no presumption or burden of proof shall arise favoring or disfavoring any signatory by virtue of the authorship of any provision of this Agreement, the allocation of risks agreed by the Parties having been observed and respected, all in accordance with articles 421 and 421-A of Law No. 10,406/2002. The Parties represent that, regardless of which Party initially provided the drafts and the wording of the clauses, each of the provisions and conditions of this Agreement was discussed during the negotiation of its terms and conditions, such that this Agreement reflects the interest of each of them in consummating the Transaction on terms and conditions with which they agree.",
    "texto2C2V_en": "1.3. <u>Joint Negotiation</u>. The Parties have been assisted by their respective counsel and have participated in the negotiation and drafting of this Agreement. In the event of any ambiguity or question of intent or interpretation, this Agreement shall be construed as having been drafted jointly by the Parties, and no presumption or burden of proof shall arise favoring or disfavoring any signatory by virtue of the authorship of any provision of this Agreement, the allocation of risks agreed by the Parties having been observed and respected, all in accordance with articles 421 and 421-A of Law No. 10,406/2002. The Parties represent that, regardless of which Party initially provided the drafts and the wording of the clauses, each of the provisions and conditions of this Agreement was discussed during the negotiation of its terms and conditions, such that this Agreement reflects the interest of each of them in consummating the Transaction on terms and conditions with which they agree.",
