    "texto2C2V_en": "1.1. <u>Definitions</u>. Capitalized words and expressions and acronyms used in this Agreement shall have the meanings ascribed to them in this Agreement and in Schedule 1.1, unless expressly provided otherwise or where the context requires a different interpretation.",
