    "texto2C2V_pt": "7.4. <u>Prática de Atos Pós Fechamento</u>. Após a realização dos atos previstos na Cláusula 7.2 acima, cada Parte deverá manter a outra Parte informada sobre o andamento das questões relativas à conclusão da Transação. Fica certo e ajustado que os registros, averbações e outras atualizações perante Terceiros e Autoridades Governamentais dos atos contemplados na Cláusula 7.2 acima ficarão a cargo e sob responsabilidade [dos Vendedores e da Companhia/das Compradoras]. Adicionalmente, os Vendedores e a Companhia (conforme o caso), se obrigam desde já, de forma irrevogável e irretratável, a praticar todos e quaisquer atos (ou fazer com que sejam praticados) e prestar todas e quaisquer informações (ou fazer com que sejam prestadas) que sejam razoavelmente necessários para a formalização, regularização e perfeita consumação dos atos contemplados na Cláusula 7.2 acima.",
    "texto1C1V_en": "7.4. <u>Post-Closing Acts</u>. After the performance of the acts set forth in Clause 7.2 above, each Party shall keep the other Party informed of the progress of matters relating to the completion of the Transaction. It is hereby agreed that the registrations, annotations and other updates before Third Parties and Governmental Authorities of the acts contemplated in Clause 7.2 above shall be the responsibility of [the Seller and the Company/the Buyer]. In addition, the Seller and the Company (as the case may be) hereby irrevocably and irreversibly undertake to perform any and all acts (or cause them to be performed) and to provide any and all information (or cause it to be provided) reasonably necessary for the formalization, regularization and full consummation of the acts contemplated in Clause 7.2 above.",
    "texto1C2V_en": "7.4. <u>Post-Closing Acts</u>. After the performance of the acts set forth in Clause 7.2 above, each Party shall keep the other Party informed of the progress of matters relating to the completion of the Transaction. It is hereby agreed that the registrations, annotations and other updates before Third Parties and Governmental Authorities of the acts contemplated in Clause 7.2 above shall be the responsibility of [the Sellers and the Company/the Buyer]. In addition, the Sellers and the Company (as the case may be) hereby irrevocably and irreversibly undertake to perform any and all acts (or cause them to be performed) and to provide any and all information (or cause it to be provided) reasonably necessary for the formalization, regularization and full consummation of the acts contemplated in Clause 7.2 above.",
    "texto2C1V_en": "7.4. <u>Post-Closing Acts</u>. After the performance of the acts set forth in Clause 7.2 above, each Party shall keep the other Party informed of the progress of matters relating to the completion of the Transaction. It is hereby agreed that the registrations, annotations and other updates before Third Parties and Governmental Authorities of the acts contemplated in Clause 7.2 above shall be the responsibility of [the Seller and the Company/the Buyers]. In addition, the Seller and the Company (as the case may be) hereby irrevocably and irreversibly undertake to perform any and all acts (or cause them to be performed) and to provide any and all information (or cause it to be provided) reasonably necessary for the formalization, regularization and full consummation of the acts contemplated in Clause 7.2 above.",
    "texto2C2V_en": "7.4. <u>Post-Closing Acts</u>. After the performance of the acts set forth in Clause 7.2 above, each Party shall keep the other Party informed of the progress of matters relating to the completion of the Transaction. It is hereby agreed that the registrations, annotations and other updates before Third Parties and Governmental Authorities of the acts contemplated in Clause 7.2 above shall be the responsibility of [the Sellers and the Company/the Buyers]. In addition, the Sellers and the Company (as the case may be) hereby irrevocably and irreversibly undertake to perform any and all acts (or cause them to be performed) and to provide any and all information (or cause it to be provided) reasonably necessary for the formalization, regularization and full consummation of the acts contemplated in Clause 7.2 above.",
