    "texto2C1V_pt": "8.1.6. <u>Capital Social e Ações Adquiridas</u>. O capital social subscrito e integralizado da Companhia é de R$[VALOR], dividido em [VALOR] ações ordinárias, nominativas, sem valor nominal, todas validamente emitidas e totalmente integralizadas, livres de Ônus, representando a totalidade do capital social e do capital votante da Companhia. O Vendedor é o único proprietário das referidas ações, sendo titular de tudo o que representam, inclusive do direito a voto, dos dividendos, das bonificações e de quaisquer direitos a elas conferidos. Não há qualquer acordo, compromisso ou promessa com relação à emissão, subscrição, aquisição, conversão, opção ou quaisquer direitos de aquisição de qualquer Ação Adquirida ou qualquer outra sociedade que, se exercidos, possam conferir aos seus respectivos titulares ações representativas do capital social da Companhia, ou direitos que poderiam ser convertidos em, ou permutados por ações representativas do capital social da Companhia.",
    "texto2C2V_pt": "8.1.6. <u>Capital Social e Ações Adquiridas</u>. O capital social subscrito e integralizado da Companhia é de R$[VALOR], dividido em [VALOR] ações ordinárias, nominativas, sem valor nominal, todas validamente emitidas e totalmente integralizadas, livres de Ônus, representando a totalidade do capital social e do capital votante da Companhia. Os Vendedores são os únicos proprietários das referidas ações, sendo titulares de tudo o que representam, inclusive do direito a voto, dos dividendos, das bonificações e de quaisquer direitos a elas conferidos. Não há qualquer acordo, compromisso ou promessa com relação à emissão, subscrição, aquisição, conversão, opção ou quaisquer direitos de aquisição de qualquer Ação Adquirida ou qualquer outra sociedade que, se exercidos, possam conferir aos seus respectivos titulares ações representativas do capital social da Companhia, ou direitos que poderiam ser convertidos em, ou permutados por ações representativas do capital social da Companhia.",
    "texto1C1V_en": "8.1.6. <u>Capital Stock and Acquired Shares</u>. The subscribed and paid-in capital stock of the Company is R$[AMOUNT], divided into [AMOUNT] common, registered shares with no par value, all validly issued and fully paid-in, free and clear of any Encumbrances, representing the entirety of the capital stock and voting capital of the Company. The Seller is the sole owner of such shares, holding everything they represent, including voting rights, dividends, bonuses and any rights conferred thereon. There is no agreement, commitment or promise regarding the issuance, subscription, acquisition, conversion, option or any acquisition rights of any Acquired Share or any other company which, if exercised, could grant their respective holders shares representing the capital stock of the Company, or rights that could be converted into or exchanged for shares representing the capital stock of the Company.",
    "texto1C2V_en": "8.1.6. <u>Capital Stock and Acquired Shares</u>. The subscribed and paid-in capital stock of the Company is R$[AMOUNT], divided into [AMOUNT] common, registered shares with no par value, all validly issued and fully paid-in, free and clear of any Encumbrances, representing the entirety of the capital stock and voting capital of the Company. The Sellers are the sole owners of such shares, holding everything they represent, including voting rights, dividends, bonuses and any rights conferred thereon. There is no agreement, commitment or promise regarding the issuance, subscription, acquisition, conversion, option or any acquisition rights of any Acquired Share or any other company which, if exercised, could grant their respective holders shares representing the capital stock of the Company, or rights that could be converted into or exchanged for shares representing the capital stock of the Company.",
    "texto2C1V_en": "8.1.6. <u>Capital Stock and Acquired Shares</u>. The subscribed and paid-in capital stock of the Company is R$[AMOUNT], divided into [AMOUNT] common, registered shares with no par value, all validly issued and fully paid-in, free and clear of any Encumbrances, representing the entirety of the capital stock and voting capital of the Company. The Seller is the sole owner of such shares, holding everything they represent, including voting rights, dividends, bonuses and any rights conferred thereon. There is no agreement, commitment or promise regarding the issuance, subscription, acquisition, conversion, option or any acquisition rights of any Acquired Share or any other company which, if exercised, could grant their respective holders shares representing the capital stock of the Company, or rights that could be converted into or exchanged for shares representing the capital stock of the Company.",
    "texto2C2V_en": "8.1.6. <u>Capital Stock and Acquired Shares</u>. The subscribed and paid-in capital stock of the Company is R$[AMOUNT], divided into [AMOUNT] common, registered shares with no par value, all validly issued and fully paid-in, free and clear of any Encumbrances, representing the entirety of the capital stock and voting capital of the Company. The Sellers are the sole owners of such shares, holding everything they represent, including voting rights, dividends, bonuses and any rights conferred thereon. There is no agreement, commitment or promise regarding the issuance, subscription, acquisition, conversion, option or any acquisition rights of any Acquired Share or any other company which, if exercised, could grant their respective holders shares representing the capital stock of the Company, or rights that could be converted into or exchanged for shares representing the capital stock of the Company.",
