    "texto2C2V_pt": "8.1.16. <u>Ativos</u>. A Companhia é a legítima possuidora, proprietária ou, conforme o caso, locatária, comodatária ou arrendatária, de todos os ativos utilizados e necessários para a condução e desenvolvimento de seus Negócios (\"<u>Ativos</u>\"). Todos os Ativos e direitos da Companhia encontram-se registrados nas Demonstrações Financeiras Base pelo respectivo custo de aquisição, deduzidas eventuais depreciações, conforme permitido pela Lei e Práticas Contábeis. Todos os Ativos estão em boas condições operacionais (ressalvado o desgaste decorrente do uso normal) e estão livres e desembaraçados de quaisquer Ônus. Os Ativos são suficientes e adequados para a continuidade dos Negócios imediatamente após a Data do Fechamento, no mesmo escopo, volume, qualidade, margem e condições atualmente praticados, sem necessidade de aquisição de ativos, direitos, sistemas, equipamentos ou contratos adicionais. Nenhum Ativo é detido, controlado, licenciado ou disponibilizado por Vendedores, Partes Relacionadas ou Terceiros sem contrato válido com a Companhia.",
    "texto1C1V_en": "8.1.16. <u>Assets</u>. The Company is the lawful possessor, owner or, as the case may be, lessee, borrower or leaseholder of all assets used in and necessary for the conduct and development of its Business (\"<u>Assets</u>\"). All Assets and rights of the Company are recorded in the Base Financial Statements at their respective acquisition cost, less any depreciation, as permitted by the Law and the Accounting Practices. All Assets are in good operating condition (except for ordinary wear and tear) and are free and clear of any Encumbrances. The Assets are sufficient and adequate for the continuity of the Business immediately after the Closing Date, in the same scope, volume, quality, margin and conditions currently practiced, without the need to acquire additional assets, rights, systems, equipment or agreements. No Asset is held, controlled, licensed or made available by the Seller, Related Parties or Third Parties without a valid agreement with the Company.",
    "texto1C2V_en": "8.1.16. <u>Assets</u>. The Company is the lawful possessor, owner or, as the case may be, lessee, borrower or leaseholder of all assets used in and necessary for the conduct and development of its Business (\"<u>Assets</u>\"). All Assets and rights of the Company are recorded in the Base Financial Statements at their respective acquisition cost, less any depreciation, as permitted by the Law and the Accounting Practices. All Assets are in good operating condition (except for ordinary wear and tear) and are free and clear of any Encumbrances. The Assets are sufficient and adequate for the continuity of the Business immediately after the Closing Date, in the same scope, volume, quality, margin and conditions currently practiced, without the need to acquire additional assets, rights, systems, equipment or agreements. No Asset is held, controlled, licensed or made available by Sellers, Related Parties or Third Parties without a valid agreement with the Company.",
