    "texto2C2V_pt": "8.1.20. <u>Proteção de Dados</u>. A Companhia adota e sempre adotou as medidas necessárias para (i) garantir segurança, confidencialidade e integridade de todos arquivos, registros, documentos, materiais, dados e informações, em formato eletrônico ou não, relacionados a qualquer pessoa natural identificada ou identificável (\"<u>Dados de Pessoas</u>\") tratados e/ou contidos em quaisquer instalações, unidades de armazenamento, localizações físicas, bases de dados e de tecnologia da informação e sistemas informáticos utilizados pela Companhia para a transmissão, tratamento, armazenamento, manutenção, organização, apresentação, geração, processamento ou análise dos Dados de Pessoas (\"<u>Sistemas DP</u>\"); (ii) se proteger contra o acesso não autorizado aos Sistemas DP ou sistemas de quaisquer terceiros que prestem serviços à Companhia e que tenham acesso aos Dados de Pessoas ou aos Sistemas DP; e (iii) tratar e manter os Dados de Pessoas e os Sistemas DP em conformidade com as Leis aplicáveis e vigentes, incluindo as Leis que tratam de privacidade e proteção de dados pessoais. A Companhia não sofreu incidente de segurança, falha material, acesso não autorizado, vazamento, perda de dados, alteração, destruição, sequestro, exfiltração, uso indevido ou qualquer comprometimento de dados pessoais, sistemas, redes, contas, credenciais ou informações confidenciais, indisponibilidade relevante, incidente cibernético, ransomware, interrupção de sistemas ou evento que tenha afetado ou possa afetar os Negócios, nem recebeu reclamação de titular, notificação, investigação, orientação, autuação ou sanção da ANPD, Procon, Ministério Público, Judiciário ou qualquer Autoridade Governamental relacionada a privacidade, proteção de dados ou segurança da informação. A Companhia está em conformidade com todas as políticas de privacidade da Companhia e com todas as Leis aplicáveis e vigentes relativas à privacidade e à proteção de dados pessoais.",
    "texto1C1V_en": "8.1.20. <u>Data Protection</u>. The Company adopts and has always adopted the necessary measures to (i) ensure the security, confidentiality and integrity of all files, records, documents, materials, data and information, in electronic form or otherwise, relating to any identified or identifiable natural person (\"<u>Personal Data</u>\") processed and/or contained in any facilities, storage units, physical locations, databases, information technology and computer systems used by the Company for the transmission, processing, storage, maintenance, organization, presentation, generation, handling or analysis of Personal Data (\"<u>DP Systems</u>\"); (ii) protect itself against unauthorized access to the DP Systems or to the systems of any third parties that provide services to the Company and that have access to Personal Data or the DP Systems; and (iii) process and maintain Personal Data and the DP Systems in compliance with the applicable Laws in force, including the Laws governing privacy and personal data protection. The Company has not suffered any security incident, material failure, unauthorized access, leak, data loss, alteration, destruction, hijacking, exfiltration, misuse or any compromise of personal data, systems, networks, accounts, credentials or confidential information, material unavailability, cyber incident, ransomware, system outage or event that has affected or may affect the Business, nor has it received any complaint from a data subject, notice, investigation, guidance, assessment or sanction from the ANPD, Procon, the Public Prosecutor's Office, the Judiciary or any Governmental Authority related to privacy, data protection or information security. The Company is in compliance with all privacy policies of the Company and with all applicable Laws in force relating to privacy and personal data protection.",
    "texto1C2V_en": "8.1.20. <u>Data Protection</u>. The Company adopts and has always adopted the necessary measures to (i) ensure the security, confidentiality and integrity of all files, records, documents, materials, data and information, in electronic form or otherwise, relating to any identified or identifiable natural person (\"<u>Personal Data</u>\") processed and/or contained in any facilities, storage units, physical locations, databases, information technology and computer systems used by the Company for the transmission, processing, storage, maintenance, organization, presentation, generation, handling or analysis of Personal Data (\"<u>DP Systems</u>\"); (ii) protect itself against unauthorized access to the DP Systems or to the systems of any third parties that provide services to the Company and that have access to Personal Data or the DP Systems; and (iii) process and maintain Personal Data and the DP Systems in compliance with the applicable Laws in force, including the Laws governing privacy and personal data protection. The Company has not suffered any security incident, material failure, unauthorized access, leak, data loss, alteration, destruction, hijacking, exfiltration, misuse or any compromise of personal data, systems, networks, accounts, credentials or confidential information, material unavailability, cyber incident, ransomware, system outage or event that has affected or may affect the Business, nor has it received any complaint from a data subject, notice, investigation, guidance, assessment or sanction from the ANPD, Procon, the Public Prosecutor's Office, the Judiciary or any Governmental Authority related to privacy, data protection or information security. The Company is in compliance with all privacy policies of the Company and with all applicable Laws in force relating to privacy and personal data protection.",
