    "texto2C2V_pt": "8.1.19. <u>Propriedade Intelectual</u>. A Companhia possui e é a única e legítima detentora dos direitos decorrentes dos registros e pedidos de registros das marcas, nomes comerciais, direitos autorais, nomes de domínio, patentes, segredos comerciais e informações confidenciais de negócio da Companhia, e quaisquer outros direitos de propriedade intelectual necessários para possibilitar que a Companhia continue conduzindo o Negócio conforme atualmente conduzido (\"<u>Direitos de Propriedade Intelectual</u>\"), não havendo sobre tais Direitos de Propriedade Intelectual qualquer Ônus ou Demanda. A lista completa de todos os Direitos de Propriedade Intelectual, incluindo marcas, softwares e endereços eletrônicos (domínios), encontra-se no Anexo 8.1.19, sendo os softwares e sistemas de informática listados os únicos em uso pela Companhia. A Companhia não utiliza outros direitos de propriedade intelectual que não os listados no referido Anexo. A Companhia não outorgou qualquer Licença ou direitos similares em relação a quaisquer dos Direitos de Propriedade Intelectual a Terceiros, tampouco transferiu ou prometeu transferir tais direitos a qualquer Terceiro. Todos os Direitos de Propriedade Intelectual da Companhia estão registrados ou são objeto de pedidos de registro, sem que, até a presente data, tenha havido qualquer oposição de Terceiros. Todas as taxas relacionadas aos referidos registros e pedidos de registro foram pagas tempestivamente e integralmente. A Companhia detém todos os direitos e o controle sobre os perfis de redes sociais e as plataformas de gestão de nomes de domínio, sites, mídias e afins, relacionados às suas atividades, inclusive LinkedIn, Instagram, Google Empresas, Google Ads, entre outros. Todas as Pessoas, incluindo empregados, que criaram, desenvolveram, adaptaram, implementaram ou contribuíram para quaisquer ativos de propriedade intelectual utilizados pela Companhia cederam todos os direitos patrimoniais aplicáveis à Companhia. Não há infração pela Companhia de direitos de propriedade intelectual de Terceiros.",
    "texto1C1V_en": "8.1.19. <u>Intellectual Property</u>. The Company owns and is the sole and lawful holder of the rights arising from the registrations and applications for registration of the trademarks, trade names, copyrights, domain names, patents, trade secrets and confidential business information of the Company, and any other intellectual property rights necessary to enable the Company to continue conducting the Business as currently conducted (\"<u>Intellectual Property Rights</u>\"), and there is no Encumbrance or Claim over such Intellectual Property Rights. The complete list of all Intellectual Property Rights, including trademarks, software and electronic addresses (domains), is set forth in Schedule 8.1.19, and the software and computer systems listed therein are the only ones in use by the Company. The Company does not use any intellectual property rights other than those listed in such Schedule. The Company has not granted any License or similar rights with respect to any of the Intellectual Property Rights to Third Parties, nor has it transferred or promised to transfer such rights to any Third Party. All Intellectual Property Rights of the Company are registered or are the subject of applications for registration, and, as of the date hereof, there has been no opposition by Third Parties. All fees related to such registrations and applications for registration have been paid timely and in full. The Company holds all rights to and control over the social media profiles and the platforms for managing domain names, websites, media and the like related to its activities, including LinkedIn, Instagram, Google Business, Google Ads, among others. All Persons, including employees, who created, developed, adapted, implemented or contributed to any intellectual property assets used by the Company have assigned all applicable economic rights to the Company. There is no infringement by the Company of intellectual property rights of Third Parties.",
    "texto1C2V_en": "8.1.19. <u>Intellectual Property</u>. The Company owns and is the sole and lawful holder of the rights arising from the registrations and applications for registration of the trademarks, trade names, copyrights, domain names, patents, trade secrets and confidential business information of the Company, and any other intellectual property rights necessary to enable the Company to continue conducting the Business as currently conducted (\"<u>Intellectual Property Rights</u>\"), and there is no Encumbrance or Claim over such Intellectual Property Rights. The complete list of all Intellectual Property Rights, including trademarks, software and electronic addresses (domains), is set forth in Schedule 8.1.19, and the software and computer systems listed therein are the only ones in use by the Company. The Company does not use any intellectual property rights other than those listed in such Schedule. The Company has not granted any License or similar rights with respect to any of the Intellectual Property Rights to Third Parties, nor has it transferred or promised to transfer such rights to any Third Party. All Intellectual Property Rights of the Company are registered or are the subject of applications for registration, and, as of the date hereof, there has been no opposition by Third Parties. All fees related to such registrations and applications for registration have been paid timely and in full. The Company holds all rights to and control over the social media profiles and the platforms for managing domain names, websites, media and the like related to its activities, including LinkedIn, Instagram, Google Business, Google Ads, among others. All Persons, including employees, who created, developed, adapted, implemented or contributed to any intellectual property assets used by the Company have assigned all applicable economic rights to the Company. There is no infringement by the Company of intellectual property rights of Third Parties.",
