    "texto2C2V_en": "8.1.19. <u>Intellectual Property</u>. The Company owns and is the sole and lawful holder of the rights arising from the registrations and applications for registration of the trademarks, trade names, copyrights, domain names, patents, trade secrets and confidential business information of the Company, and any other intellectual property rights necessary to enable the Company to continue conducting the Business as currently conducted (\"<u>Intellectual Property Rights</u>\"), and there is no Encumbrance or Claim over such Intellectual Property Rights. The complete list of all Intellectual Property Rights, including trademarks, software and electronic addresses (domains), is set forth in Schedule 8.1.19, and the software and computer systems listed therein are the only ones in use by the Company. The Company does not use any intellectual property rights other than those listed in such Schedule. The Company has not granted any License or similar rights with respect to any of the Intellectual Property Rights to Third Parties, nor has it transferred or promised to transfer such rights to any Third Party. All Intellectual Property Rights of the Company are registered or are the subject of applications for registration, and, as of the date hereof, there has been no opposition by Third Parties. All fees related to such registrations and applications for registration have been paid timely and in full. The Company holds all rights to and control over the social media profiles and the platforms for managing domain names, websites, media and the like related to its activities, including LinkedIn, Instagram, Google Business, Google Ads, among others. All Persons, including employees, who created, developed, adapted, implemented or contributed to any intellectual property assets used by the Company have assigned all applicable economic rights to the Company. There is no infringement by the Company of intellectual property rights of Third Parties.",
