    "texto2C2V_pt": "8.1.22. <u>Inteligência Artificial</u>. Exceto conforme descrito no Anexo 8.1.22, a Companhia não desenvolve, licencia, incorpora, comercializa ou utiliza, de forma material para os Negócios, sistemas de inteligência artificial, machine learning, modelos preditivos, modelos generativos, automação decisória ou ferramentas similares. Quando aplicável, todos os sistemas de inteligência artificial utilizados ou desenvolvidos pela Companhia cumprem as Leis aplicáveis, contratos, políticas internas, direitos de propriedade intelectual, normas de privacidade e proteção de dados, deveres de transparência e segurança, e não utilizam dados, conteúdos, modelos, outputs ou materiais de Terceiros de forma que possa gerar violação de direitos, discriminação, responsabilidade regulatória, contratual, consumerista, trabalhista, concorrencial ou reputacional.",
    "texto1C1V_en": "8.1.22. <u>Artificial Intelligence</u>. Except as described in Schedule 8.1.22, the Company does not develop, license, incorporate, market or use, in a manner material to the Business, artificial intelligence systems, machine learning, predictive models, generative models, automated decision-making or similar tools. Where applicable, all artificial intelligence systems used or developed by the Company comply with applicable Laws, agreements, internal policies, intellectual property rights, privacy and data protection rules, and transparency and security duties, and do not use data, content, models, outputs or materials of Third Parties in a manner that could give rise to infringement of rights, discrimination, or regulatory, contractual, consumer, labor, antitrust or reputational liability.",
    "texto1C2V_en": "8.1.22. <u>Artificial Intelligence</u>. Except as described in Schedule 8.1.22, the Company does not develop, license, incorporate, market or use, in a manner material to the Business, artificial intelligence systems, machine learning, predictive models, generative models, automated decision-making or similar tools. Where applicable, all artificial intelligence systems used or developed by the Company comply with applicable Laws, agreements, internal policies, intellectual property rights, privacy and data protection rules, and transparency and security duties, and do not use data, content, models, outputs or materials of Third Parties in a manner that could give rise to infringement of rights, discrimination, or regulatory, contractual, consumer, labor, antitrust or reputational liability.",
