    "texto1C1V_en": "8.1.31. <u>Insurance</u>. All insurance policies currently maintained by the Company are listed in Schedule 8.1.31 and (i) are in full force and effect in accordance with their terms and conditions; (ii) are sufficient to comply with all legal requirements; and (iii) provide coverage in amounts and against risks compatible with and adequate for the activities carried out by the Company, in accordance with usual market practices. All due premiums related to such policies have been paid and there is no notice of cancellation or non-renewal relating to them. The Company has timely notified and reported any and all claims covered by such insurance policies. The Company has not performed any act or omitted to act with respect to the business of the Company in a manner inconsistent with the respective insurance policies that would release the insurers named in such policies from liability for any indemnification claim based on such policies.",
