    "texto2C1V_pt": "8.1.32. <u>Contas Correntes; Procurações</u>. O Anexo 8.1.32 contém uma lista de todas as contas correntes abertas em nome da Companhia junto a instituições financeiras, bem como a lista das pessoas com poderes para movimentá-las. Todas as procurações outorgadas pela Companhia, que não contenham exclusivamente poderes ad judicia, que estão em vigor nesta data encontram-se listadas no Anexo 8.1.32.",
    "texto2C2V_pt": "8.1.32. <u>Contas Correntes; Procurações</u>. O Anexo 8.1.32 contém uma lista de todas as contas correntes abertas em nome da Companhia junto a instituições financeiras, bem como a lista das pessoas com poderes para movimentá-las. Todas as procurações outorgadas pela Companhia, que não contenham exclusivamente poderes ad judicia, que estão em vigor nesta data encontram-se listadas no Anexo 8.1.32.",
    "texto1C1V_en": "8.1.32. <u>Bank Accounts; Powers of Attorney</u>. Schedule 8.1.32 contains a list of all bank accounts opened in the name of the Company with financial institutions, as well as the list of persons with powers to operate them. All powers of attorney granted by the Company that do not contain exclusively ad judicia powers and that are in force as of this date are listed in Schedule 8.1.32.",
    "texto1C2V_en": "8.1.32. <u>Bank Accounts; Powers of Attorney</u>. Schedule 8.1.32 contains a list of all bank accounts opened in the name of the Company with financial institutions, as well as the list of persons with powers to operate them. All powers of attorney granted by the Company that do not contain exclusively ad judicia powers and that are in force as of this date are listed in Schedule 8.1.32.",
    "texto2C1V_en": "8.1.32. <u>Bank Accounts; Powers of Attorney</u>. Schedule 8.1.32 contains a list of all bank accounts opened in the name of the Company with financial institutions, as well as the list of persons with powers to operate them. All powers of attorney granted by the Company that do not contain exclusively ad judicia powers and that are in force as of this date are listed in Schedule 8.1.32.",
    "texto2C2V_en": "8.1.32. <u>Bank Accounts; Powers of Attorney</u>. Schedule 8.1.32 contains a list of all bank accounts opened in the name of the Company with financial institutions, as well as the list of persons with powers to operate them. All powers of attorney granted by the Company that do not contain exclusively ad judicia powers and that are in force as of this date are listed in Schedule 8.1.32.",
