    "texto1C2V_pt": "8.1.40. <u>Cumprimento de Leis</u>. Os Vendedores e a Companhia, conforme o caso, sempre cumpriram todos os requisitos das Leis aplicáveis no desenvolvimento de seus negócios, na administração de seus bens e direitos e no cumprimento de suas respectivas obrigações.",
    "texto2C1V_pt": "8.1.40. <u>Cumprimento de Leis</u>. O Vendedor e a Companhia, conforme o caso, sempre cumpriram todos os requisitos das Leis aplicáveis no desenvolvimento de seus negócios, na administração de seus bens e direitos e no cumprimento de suas respectivas obrigações.",
    "texto2C2V_pt": "8.1.40. <u>Cumprimento de Leis</u>. Os Vendedores e a Companhia, conforme o caso, sempre cumpriram todos os requisitos das Leis aplicáveis no desenvolvimento de seus negócios, na administração de seus bens e direitos e no cumprimento de suas respectivas obrigações.",
    "texto1C1V_en": "8.1.40. <u>Compliance with Laws</u>. The Seller and the Company, as the case may be, have always complied with all requirements of the applicable Laws in the conduct of their business, in the management of their assets and rights and in the performance of their respective obligations.",
    "texto1C2V_en": "8.1.40. <u>Compliance with Laws</u>. The Sellers and the Company, as the case may be, have always complied with all requirements of the applicable Laws in the conduct of their business, in the management of their assets and rights and in the performance of their respective obligations.",
    "texto2C1V_en": "8.1.40. <u>Compliance with Laws</u>. The Seller and the Company, as the case may be, have always complied with all requirements of the applicable Laws in the conduct of their business, in the management of their assets and rights and in the performance of their respective obligations.",
    "texto2C2V_en": "8.1.40. <u>Compliance with Laws</u>. The Sellers and the Company, as the case may be, have always complied with all requirements of the applicable Laws in the conduct of their business, in the management of their assets and rights and in the performance of their respective obligations.",
